What are Jogging Shoes?
Jogging shoes are purpose built footwear that balances cushioning, breathability, and lightweight construction. Unlike heavyweight trail boots, they are optimized for pavement and park paths, offering a responsive ride that reduces joint stress during repeated short run intervals. Modern iterations incorporate carbon fiber plates for propulsion, knitted uppers for a sock like fit, and smart midsoles equipped with sensors that deliver real time gait analytics to connected devices.
